      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:26Z",
      "text": "The UN was founded in 1945 by the Soviet Union, the United States and 4 others.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q1065:P571",
        "wd:Q1065:P112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:36Z",
      "text": "Companies it owns on record include the United Nations Security Council, the World Intellectual Property Organization and 4 others.",
